# Russian's number words, in the places Polish wrote for its own. Italian's
# are in the wrappers its own arms call, one wrapper to a word with the word
# and its length baked into the name, so a word of Polish's was a wrapper of
# its own and one call name changed in the arm, and Russian's are the same
# wrappers with Russian's words in them. A word shorter than the length an
# arm inserts is filled out with spaces, and one longer is written as it is
# said: одиннадцать is одинацать, as дц is ц. The units are inserted by
